WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.100
- All right, time is
almost up for this hour,

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.800
but first I wanna share one more story

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.200
to make you smile possibly.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.404
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.404 --> 00:00:09.020
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.900
Today is World Down Syndrome Day.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.500
And it's all about spreading awareness

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.850
about people living with the condition.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.690
A few years ago, a Chicago man

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:18.300
with Down syndrome was
on the hunt for a job

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.510
and when he couldn't find any work

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:20.750
he decided to take control

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.440
and launched his very own business,

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.550
creating hand painted doormats.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:25.412
Check these out.

00:00:25.412 --> 00:00:27.995
(upbeat music)

00:00:34.696 --> 00:00:37.790
His business, This Is
Jacob, is a total success.

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:39.840
Now he's taken to TikTok with a new goal.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.730
And all I can say is I'm very flattered.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:43.913
- Hi guys.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:51.393
Can you guys help me to go
on The Kelly Clarkson Show?

00:00:53.323 --> 00:00:56.310
I really want to go on her show.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:57.690
So please share this.

00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:01.630
- Oh, we have Jacob on the line

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:03.290
along with his mama, Melanie.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:04.230
How y'all doing?

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.095
What's up Jacob?

00:01:05.095 --> 00:01:05.955
(audience cheering)

00:01:05.955 --> 00:01:06.788
- Hi guys.

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:09.370
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:12.410
So Melanie, tell us more about
how this all came together.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:16.730
- [Melanie] So when Jacob
aged out of high school

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:18.660
he started looking for a job, right?

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.010
'Cause that's what you do.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:24.400
And he didn't, not have very much success.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.450
So he was getting a little discouraged

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:30.050
and his sister was actually looking

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:34.390
to have a custom mat made at
that time for their grandpa.

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:37.130
So Jacob said, "I think
I could make that."

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.320
And he did.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.170
And it came out beautiful.

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.237
And shortly after that
he came up to us and said

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:45.877
"I wanna start my own business

00:01:45.877 --> 00:01:48.539
and I'm gonna call it, This is Jacob."

00:01:48.539 --> 00:01:51.498
And that's exactly what he did.

00:01:51.498 --> 00:01:53.650
Started off making doormats

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:56.370
and selling them to family and friends.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:59.050
And then as his business grew

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:03.280
through Facebook and word of mouth,

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:07.720
a local news station did a story on him.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:10.730
And after that, his business blew up

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.620
and he's been steady ever since.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.550
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh,
Jacob I'm so proud of you.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:17.620
This is so rad.

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:18.453
It is awesome

00:02:18.453 --> 00:02:19.817
to meet you.
- [Jacob] Thank you.

00:02:19.817 --> 00:02:22.768
- Yes I wish I could hug
you in person right now.

00:02:22.768 --> 00:02:24.106
(laughs)

00:02:24.106 --> 00:02:27.540
So Jacob, you donate a lot
of your profits, right?

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:32.540
- I do, yes to, I give away my money

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:36.090
to the Dear Mom Conference

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:40.960
and it feels good to help other
people with Down syndrome.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:41.936
- Oh, that's amazing.

00:02:41.936 --> 00:02:43.059
(audience claps)

00:02:43.059 --> 00:02:46.190
Well you have a new mat that
you wanna show me, right?

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:48.450
I heard there was a mat
that you wanna show me.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:49.283
- I do, yes.

00:02:49.283 --> 00:02:51.339
- Okay, let me see it.

00:02:51.339 --> 00:02:54.006
It's the doormat I made for you.

00:02:55.422 --> 00:02:56.625
(audience cheering)

00:02:56.625 --> 00:02:58.887
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:00.167
I will buy that from you

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:02.650
and have it like right
before I enter my office.

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:03.483
I love that.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.053
Thank you so much, Jacob.

00:03:05.053 --> 00:03:07.360
(audience clapping)
- You're welcome.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:08.610
- And thank you Melanie.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:10.320
And ma'am I don't know, your name.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:12.249
What was your name in the back?

00:03:12.249 --> 00:03:13.360
- Elise.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.290
- Elise, thank you so much too.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:17.390
You were holding it up
beautifully Vanna White.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:19.410
I'm liking your post right now.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:20.546
Okay, Jacob.

00:03:20.546 --> 00:03:22.217
(bell rings)

00:03:22.217 --> 00:03:23.050
- [Jacob] Thank you so much.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.678
- [Melanie] Thank you so much.

00:03:24.678 --> 00:03:25.880
- All right, well that's not all

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:28.360
our season long partner
Pilot Pen makers of Frixion

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:30.560
the Go-To Erasable Pen of
the Kelly Clarkson show

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.720
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:33.860
just like you, sir.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.450
So they're going to be giving you $1000.

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:37.283
How's that sound?

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:40.788
(audience cheers)

00:03:40.788 --> 00:03:42.976
- That's amazing thank you very much.

00:03:42.976 --> 00:03:43.809
- Thank you.

00:03:43.809 --> 00:03:45.350
- [Kelly] It's lovely to meet y'all.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.300
Have a blessed day.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.953
Thank you so much for joining us.

